<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυθρ-ιάω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιόων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Musae.
					161
				</span></i>
			 : impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρυθρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Laps.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			, etc.: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρυθρίᾱσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					204c
				</span></i>
			, etc.: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρυθρίᾱκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					37.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηρυθριᾱκότως</span>): —<i>blush, colour up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				312a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.128
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστεῖόν γε..ὅτι ἐρυθριᾷς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					204c
				</span></i>
			 : c. part., <i>blush at</i> doing, <i><span class="en">
				Dromo
				1
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅστις δ᾽ ἐρυθριᾷ..πρὸς τοὺς ἑαυτοῦ
					γονέας, οὐκ ἔστιν κακός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					261
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				782
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				135
			</span></i> ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινά</span>
			<i>to blush before</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				3.38
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀρχήν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i> : c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.310
			</span></i>, Chor.in <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				4.775
			</span></i> Reiske. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be inflamed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>.</div>
